## 1. Creating S3 Bucket
medivault-scan-images-bucket01
Asia Pacific (Mumbai); ap-south-1
Choose: Bucket owner enforced; This disables S3 ACLs.
Block Public Access - Block all public access — Enabled
Bucket Versioning - Disable
Encryption - Select SSE-S3
Object Lifecycle - Don't configure

Bucket Properties Summary:
| Setting          | Choice                |
| ---------------- | --------------------- |
| Region           | `ap-south-1`          |
| Object ownership | Bucket owner enforced |
| Public access    | **Blocked**           |
| Versioning       | Disabled initially    |
| Encryption       | SSE-S3                |
| Lifecycle        | None initially        |
| Purpose          | MediVault scan images |

## 2. IAM - connect EC2 to S3 securely

EC2
 ↓
IAM Role
 ↓
